@startuml
title Sistema de compras en línea — Diagrama de Componentes

' ===== Interfaces =====
interface "IConsultaCatálogo" as ICatalog
interface "ITotalCarrito" as ICart
interface "IProcesamientoPago" as IPayProc
interface "IEventoPago" as IPayEvt

' ===== Componentes =====
component "Catálogo" as Catalog
component "Carrito de Compras" as Cart
component "Pago" as Pay
component "Notificación" as Notify

' ===== Interfaces provistas =====
Catalog - ICatalog
Cart - ICart
Pay - IPayProc
Pay - IPayEvt

' ===== Interfaces requeridas (dependencias) =====
Cart ..> ICatalog : consulta títulos/precios
Pay ..> ICart : requiere total e ítems
Cart ..> IPayProc : invoca cobro
Notify ..> IPayEvt : recibe confirmación/estado

@enduml